msgctxt "328"
msgid "This is no time to be chatting with the driver."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "Hello?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "Kazuma? It's me, Joji."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "What's up, Joji?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "I'm just about back in Tokyo. Where are you now?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Getting in a cab. I'm going to the hospital to finally put\r\n"
"an end to this madness."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Good. But listen, Kazuma. There's something I need to tell\r\n"
"you before you go."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "What's that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid ""
"I just had headquarters issue an order to all active agents\r\n"
"in the Tokyo metropolitan area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "The CIA will have your back every step of the way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"Huh. Guess that explains why an agent walked up to me not\r\n"
"too long ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid "There's one team we haven't been able to get in touch with, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Remember, the CIA's goal here is apprehending Richardson."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "I'm not sure why we can't reach that team..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"But if you run into them, it's likely they'll see you as a\r\n"
"mere obstacle in their path."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Hm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "Worst comes to worst, you may even have to fight them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid "Just... watch your back, Kazuma."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Thanks, Joji. I will."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid ""
"(Guess I'll need to watch out for more than just Mine's\r\n"
"men...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "Sir? Excuse me, sir? Are you getting in or not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "640"
msgid "Huh? Oh, yeah. Sorry."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid "(I seriously don't have 710 yen for the taxi...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "The minimum fare is 710 yen. Where would you like to go?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Are you sure? It will cost you about 30,000 yen to get there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "Yeah, take me there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid "Very well, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "I'm afraid you don't have enough money, sir. Please come again when you do."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid "Very well, sir. Yokoda Airfield it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "Very well, sir. Touto Hospital it is."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid "Very well, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Very well, sir."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid "(Guess this is goodbye for now...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "(Actually, maybe not yet.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid ""
"Rikiya. This taxi will take you to the airport. Make sure you get on your "
"flight, okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid "Aniki, I..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "I'll be fine. Just make sure Nakahara and the kids are safe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid ""
"After all, we still don't know who we're up against. It sounds like this "
"whole thing is out of the Tojo Clan's hands, at the very least."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1060"
msgid ""
"And with Nakahara still in the hospital, you're the only one\r\n"
"those kids can rely on. Same goes for the Ryudo Family."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid "They're all counting on you, Rikiya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "...Right. I won't let them down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"Anyway, guess it's time for me to go. Try keepin' yourself\r\n"
"outta harm's way... Okay, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Yeah. I'll be home soon."
msgstr ""

